e zone (GMT to local correction) \"sigFigs\" -- accuracy of timestamps \"snapLen\" -- maximum packet size \"network\" -- data link type \"count\" -- total number of packets read in this file. Your program will have to calculate this and for each packet   a packet number, starting at 0 (See posted format) \"tmSec\" -- timestamp seconds \"tmUSec\" -- timestamp microseconds \"inclLen\" -- number of octets/bytes of packet in the pcap file \"origLen\" -- number of octets/byets of packet on the network (will be same as inclLen unless bigger than snapLen  Sample output format: (newlines don't matter here. Also, order of fields in {...}  don't matter. ","topics":[],"score":2373,"global_rank":87533},{"name":"ddonco/CS132","owner":"ddonco","html_url":"https://github.com/ddonco/CS132","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2373,"global_rank":87575},{"name":"ddonco/CS133","owner":"ddonco","html_url":"https://github.com/ddonco/CS133","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2373,"global_rank":87576},{"name":"phamav/phamavProject3","owner":"phamav","html_url":"https://github.com/phamav/phamavProject3","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2373,"global_rank":87597},{"name":"mbucchia/VarjoPatchCompositor","owner":"mbucchia","html_url":"https://github.com/mbucchia/VarjoPatchCompositor","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2373,"global_rank":87600},{"name":"Kiyoshika/gosub-client-windows","owner":"Kiyoshika","html_url":"https://github.com/Kiyoshika/gosub-client-windows","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"A prototype native windows client for the Gosub browser","topics":[],"score":2373,"global_rank":87618},{"name":"datamathur/GFG-DSA","owner":"datamathur","html_url":"https://github.com/datamathur/GFG-DSA